  <meta name="description" content="Use our free online compass tool and digital spirit level. Get accurate live compass direction, degrees, and a precision bull's eye spirit level for mobile.">
  <meta name="keywords" content="compass rose tool, compass, compass mobile, online compass geometry, online compass tool geometry, free online compass tool, online compass live, online compass to find north, live compass on phone, compass direction, compass with degrees online, compass rose on a map, the spirit level, digital spirit level, spirit level tool, spirit level compass, online spirit level free, bull's eye spirit level, tools spirit level, precision spirit level, spirit level online, magnetic spirit level">
